Here's the problem file for storing a keychain in a drawer:

```pddl
(define (problem store_keychain_problem)
  (:domain robot2)
  (:objects
    robot2 - robot
    KeyChain - object
    Drawer - object
    SideTable - object
  )
  (:init
    (at robot2 SideTable)
    (at-location KeyChain SideTable)
    (at-location Drawer SideTable)
    (not (inaction robot2))
    (object-open robot2 Drawer)
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (at-location KeyChain Drawer)
      (object-close robot2 Drawer)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.